@Gclopes.FinVault.PensionPlans_HostAddress = http://localhost:5274

### List all pension plan / insurance movements (requires a valid JWT Bearer token)
GET {{Gclopes.FinVault.PensionPlans_HostAddress}}/api/pension-plans/movements
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Import a batch of movements (called by the PDF parser service, no auth required)
POST {{Gclopes.FinVault.PensionPlans_HostAddress}}/api/pension-plans/movements
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "movement": "Encerramento do Mês",
    "receipt": null,
    "date": "2026-06-30",
    "debit": 0.00,
    "credit": 12.50,
    "balance": 15234.67
  },
  {
    "movement": "Liquidação de Prémio",
    "receipt": "260192738",
    "date": "2026-06-08",
    "debit": 0.0,
    "credit": 150.0,
    "balance": 15222.17
  }
]

